      "cooked": "<p>Bringing this one in late, but since it was a nice easy match, there really wasn’t much to say!<br>\nBaron Blade vs. Completionist Guise, Legacy, Bunker and Wraith in Insula Primalis.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/19006e5a1dad3f388a332a83f9c6c7686cb094d2.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/19006e5a1dad3f388a332a83f9c6c7686cb094d2\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/19006e5a1dad3f388a332a83f9c6c7686cb094d2_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"3zaRl1BtTBzVawkT5fVimlqyfxE\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/19006e5a1dad3f388a332a83f9c6c7686cb094d2_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/19006e5a1dad3f388a332a83f9c6c7686cb094d2_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/19006e5a1dad3f388a332a83f9c6c7686cb094d2_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/19006e5a1dad3f388a332a83f9c6c7686cb094d2_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">828×1792 119 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nLots of fun to have with Completionist Guise, but I find it fairly easy to use Super Scientist Tachyon and then switch over to her Freedom Five version. You can double dip in the Legacy pool by swapping between Legacy and America’s Greatest Legacy every round to add some extra damage as well.</p>",
